          converges to a constant 0 loss. When beta is 0, Smooth L1 loss is equivalent to L1 loss.
        * As beta -> :math:`+\infty`, Smooth L1 loss converges to a constant 0 loss, while
          :class:`HuberLoss` converges to :class:`MSELoss`.
